        },
        "body": "This PR upgrades this dependency to use tokio 1.0.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, we use the more higher-level reqwest http client instead of hyper to talk to the servers. \r\n\r\nA lot of code has been rewritten/refactored, and futures have been modernized to use async fn's where possible.",
